              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dixie is a collectible card game that uses cards and dice to simulate American Civil War battles."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Columbia Games in 1994 and designed by Tom Dalgliesh, Dixie adapts historical battle simulation into a collectible card format."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
